    this Fusion Summoned card: You can toss a coin and call it. Destroy as many monsters
    on the field as possible, and if you do, inflict damage equal to half the total
    original ATK of the destroyed face-up monsters. If you called the coin toss right,
    your opponent takes the damage, if you called it wrong, you take the damage.'
